msgid "Our Mission"
msgstr "رسالتنا"

#: .\main_app\templates\about.html:29
msgid ""
"To deliver agile, premium workspace solutions and seamless administrative "
"support, empowering businesses to scale efficiently and operate with "
"absolute professionalism."
